### =========================================================================
### FLIPPLAY REST API - UJI ENDPOINT (DEMO MODUL 4)
### Urutan uji sesuai Alur yang Diharapkan & Pengujian (Modul 4 hal. 29-30)
### Jalankan server terlebih dahulu: php artisan serve
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### HAPPY PATH (ALUR SUKSES)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. List seluruh media tersedia (GET Index + Pagination + Eager Load users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/media
Accept: application/json

### 2. Cari media berdasarkan judul (Query Filter ?search=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/media?search=Frieren
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lihat detail 1 media beserta pengguna yang memasukkannya ke koleksi
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Tambah media baru bertipe Movie (POST -> 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "type": "movie",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi, Action",
  "rating": 8.8,
  "release_year": 2010,
  "duration_minutes": 148,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan"
}

### 5. Tambah media baru bertipe Anime (POST -> 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood",
  "type": "anime",
  "genre": "Action, Adventure",
  "rating": 9.2,
  "release_year": 2009,
  "total_episodes": 64,
  "studio": "Bones"
}

### 6. Update sebagian data media tanpa bentrok validasi unique judul (PATCH -> 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/media/5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rating": 9.0,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi, Thriller"
}

### 7. Tambah media ke koleksi pribadi pengguna (POST attach -> 201 Created)
### Contoh: Bob (user 2) menambahkan Spirited Away (media 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/collection
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "media_id": 3
}

### 8. Tampilkan koleksi media milik seorang pengguna (GET -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2/collection
Accept: application/json

### 9. Hapus media dari koleksi pengguna (DELETE detach -> 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2/collection/3
Accept: application/json

### 10. Hapus media dari sistem (DELETE -> 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/media/5
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### FAILURE PATH (PENGUJIAN VALIDASI & ERROR HANDLING)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 11. Tambah media dengan judul kosong -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "type": "movie",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "rating": 8.0,
  "release_year": 2022,
  "duration_minutes": 110,
  "director": "Unknown"
}

### 12. Tambah media dengan judul duplikat -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Sousou no Frieren",
  "type": "anime",
  "genre": "Adventure",
  "rating": 9.1,
  "release_year": 2023,
  "total_episodes": 28,
  "studio": "Madhouse"
}

### 13. Tambah media tipe movie tanpa durasi & sutradara -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune Part Two",
  "type": "movie",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "rating": 8.6,
  "release_year": 2024
}

### 14. Tambah media yang sama 2x ke koleksi Alice (media_id 1 sudah ada) -> 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/collection
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "media_id": 1
}

### 15. Hapus media yang tidak ada di koleksi user -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2/collection/1
Accept: application/json

### 16. Akses detail media ID yang tidak ada -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/9999
Accept: application/json
